      "title": "IAMCCS · RELAYVSR / DLSS 5 / HDR",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# IAMCCS · The HDR Finishing Pass\n\n**Load one SDR video.** RelayVSR ×2 → DLSS 5 at 1× → RTX Video HDR PQ → 10-bit master.\n\nSet Create Video FPS to the source FPS. This example runs at 24 fps. The original audio connects directly to Create Video. Load both ×2 Relay files and install the DLSS 5 runtime and RTX Video HDR nodes before running."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "# IAMCCS · The HDR Finishing Pass\n\n**Load one SDR video.** RelayVSR ×2 → DLSS 5 at 1× → RTX Video HDR PQ → 10-bit master.\n\nSet Create Video FPS to the source FPS. This example runs at 24 fps. The original audio connects directly to Create Video. Load both ×2 Relay files and install the DLSS 5 runtime and RTX Video HDR nodes before running."
      },
      "color": "#253745",
      "bgcolor": "#141d24"
    },
